            <div xml:id="m-9eadf3fa-9937-450f-bb07-0b4faf865c5b">
              <lg xml:id="m-9ad7a84f-f3f6-410e-b924-624439604366">
                <l xml:id="m-4bd628c2-4b6a-40b6-9197-deb30ab7135b" facs="#m-3f203551-78f8-4c66-ba9c-5e208d585c2d" label="text-like">Feasts of the Blessed Virgin Mary. Prime.</l><l xml:id="m-8b46e9b9-db23-408c-a1f7-fa91b2ee02d8" facs="#m-e8510269-14f8-4fff-835f-2a77ff0223a4" label="ambiguous">1255</l><l xml:id="m-0afe00a8-4d3d-4792-97fc-038e6bb8dd79" facs="#m-6081dc4a-d770-40d3-b80a-8b65a83e3cbe" label="lyrics-like">ne-o séxu: sénti-ant ómnes tú-um juvá-men, “ qui-cúm¬</l><l xml:id="m-88683ff1-b73d-43da-855c-68894e773b6b" facs="#m-023d4d53-4b06-4357-be49-fbb03d716295" label="lyrics-like">que cé-lebrant t tú-am sánctam festi-vi-tá-tem. T. P. Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-e970e4c0-a66a-4e38-8f81-9ea9b506b406" facs="#m-910c330a-5620-408b-bdf9-8a8161121b1a" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-be24c294-b220-4987-9c97-0203774d2270" facs="#m-c53bceae-3567-4122-af07-e2dd5cba6923" label="text-like">Feast of</l><l xml:id="m-02572868-58a5-41c1-8418-4fc5b8337bea" facs="#m-618e2dd6-5eed-4862-a48a-61dd15e8340f" label="text-like">our Lady of</l><l xml:id="m-4e589f0e-c507-4982-b832-8fa10aaf5268" facs="#m-0dbc60ee-faf5-4634-8214-fc895642f710" label="ambiguous">Mount Carmel.</l><l xml:id="m-acbf581e-c0ab-420f-9b18-0714c5e1d715" facs="#m-fc338b9a-cce8-4890-8979-979cba4ba623" label="lyrics-like">t tú-am sol-émnem commemo-ra-ti¬ nem.</l><l xml:id="m-5e8e1cbf-82eb-4908-9cb9-2f1d34f4e70b" facs="#m-f93dc311-1a42-4de0-bd67-24a8f99d0e58" label="text-like">Feast of</l><l xml:id="m-96f33aa7-0472-4287-b88d-5e7fc8587d3f" facs="#m-69cd151f-dbad-4654-ac55-fd009b2acb2d" label="text-like">the Holy Name</l><l xml:id="m-1e40b25a-67c6-4fdb-9faf-00aa75da93e3" facs="#m-7c64c12d-b38c-4c42-b00f-203ea13937c4" label="text-like">of Mary.</l><l xml:id="m-c46726b7-5c98-468f-825d-eab54c6c6a63" facs="#m-116418f3-0bd0-4381-95bb-9e2060bd3c50" label="lyrics-like">t tú-i sáncti Nóminis commemo-ra-ti- onem.</l><l xml:id="m-79dac0ce-a11d-4b6d-8c75-1864cc5696b1" facs="#m-92105b27-07e5-4129-8715-df57d330960e" label="text-like">Feast of</l><l xml:id="m-c4b1d1f5-e2b6-4ac0-ae3e-8297b637d331" facs="#m-6a82c8ac-51af-4988-81e2-1b0754b8a4fb" label="ambiguous">our Lady, Help</l><l xml:id="m-81f8120f-c3dd-45dd-b8d2-1f7899944981" facs="#m-ae5d0a04-8756-40d5-bcd9-4b412a9957ed" label="text-like">of Christians.</l><l xml:id="m-c4eeceba-ec93-43fe-85db-268032438ed7" facs="#m-75b70c7a-5d9c-4ccf-8ec4-be681920876d" label="lyrics-like">qui-cúmque tú-um sánctum impló-rant au¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a763acd-a02d-45dc-9f79-28eb550e3450" facs="#m-f47def0e-0db2-4421-8812-53639d3d86c7" label="lyrics-like">xí-li-um. Alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-fb369d75-ca9e-4359-9391-10e523ea3057" facs="#m-fd014cfa-ab75-494c-b7af-28be57b4fbeb" label="ambiguous">Patronage</l><l xml:id="m-de6486ea-e5c3-46a0-8cd3-66f4761f206a" facs="#m-49f95f85-e623-4393-8c39-b1497ff6bbe5" label="text-like">of the</l><l xml:id="m-49dfef39-5bc3-402e-bc7c-cfbcf751565f" facs="#m-7e1db4c8-0b46-41b6-94f3-b7c6187d03aa" label="ambiguous">B. V. M.</l><l xml:id="m-798fedf1-3b6e-4388-8446-aa7abe0dfc2e" facs="#m-2449097a-3ba6-4dff-9273-475599957dd7" label="lyrics-like">t tú-um sánctum Patro-cíni-um.</l><l xml:id="m-852ddb8c-ea8b-4cf3-a07f-0b5c60d3fc2b" facs="#m-44dd8ce0-2a89-4718-8d40-23304fb0e6c0" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 4. E. 210, or p. 216. — Prayer, p. 1263.</l><l xml:id="m-82cfeec1-2ba2-420b-86d4-961772d89f09" facs="#m-feb8894f-c605-4bb6-82c7-f472d6ccac70" label="text-like">At Compline. Psalms of Sunday. The Hymn is sung in the tone for</l><l xml:id="m-f8a65769-860c-40f8-8969-605df7fcdd34" facs="#m-014768fa-6285-4d2b-a563-97002557254a" label="text-like">Feasts or the Blessed Virgin. p. 268.</l><l xml:id="m-92012873-2942-456b-8424-a436a030f3f0" facs="#m-d20978f8-c2d1-4b16-b340-9f667c86aeca" label="text-like">At Prime. The Hymn is sung in the tone indicated for Terce. Psalms</l><l xml:id="m-686d41db-5c95-44f7-bcf6-7a461782b85a" facs="#m-9f8aa245-a976-471a-b15f-72dd42fff239" label="text-like">as on Feasts.</l><l xml:id="m-342027d5-8412-496c-9044-dc7e1959d606" facs="#m-279379b0-d53e-4368-b41b-c5390bb9ff8a" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Dum ésset rex. p. 1258. In the Short Resp., the V. is Qui nátus</l><l xml:id="m-2cc55251-7da5-4f37-b7b0-8aab43bcf06e" facs="#m-15d4f468-ba7a-47a9-94f0-8a6f6bb42854" label="lyrics-like">es de Maria Virgine. This V. Is also said throughout the Ôctaves o</l><l xml:id="m-ee55d3e1-f8f6-412e-ae1e-bdeaae5d7521" facs="#m-e2b1fcca-dcf1-4fce-ad28-8046ab317a1c" label="text-like">feasts of the B. V. M., except during Advent in the office of the Time.</l><l xml:id="m-ee19b185-a113-493b-a369-897007f20c1b" facs="#m-398afb5e-945b-4923-8cfb-9a09e5559e07" label="lyrics-like">Short Lesson. In platéis. D. 1257.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
